  <DocumentNotes>
    <Note Title="Topic" Type="Summary" Ordinal="1" xml:lang="en">Security update for jq</Note>
    <Note Title="Details" Type="General" Ordinal="2" xml:lang="en">This update for jq fixes the following issues:

- CVE-2026-43895: embedded NUL bytes in import paths can lead to policy bypass and sensitive information disclosure
  (bsc#1265071).
- CVE-2026-47770: stack overflow in deep structural equality (bsc#1269221).
</Note>
